WEBVTT

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.820
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:09.420
I wound up in the Digital World,

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:11.150
where I met Shoutmon 
and the other Digimon.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:16.330
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:16.330
<b>Enemy?                              The battle begins!                              Enemy</b>

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:16.330
<b>Team ?                       Team Taiki                    Team Kiriha</b>

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:16.330
Mysterious
Girl

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:16.330
<b>Enemy?                                    Enemy?

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:16.330
Rival

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:16.330
Protagonist

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:13.370
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.330
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:17.630 --> 00:00:21.830
Our Xros Heart team arrived 
in a new area, the Lake Zone,

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:24.370
and saved Knightmon, who was 
on the verge of disappearing.

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:29.150
Thankfully we were able to protect 
the princess in the castle,

00:00:29.150 --> 00:00:31.740
but I overdid it and collapsed.

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:41.990
<b>Burn, Xros Heart!</b>

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:38.090
Burn, Xros Heart!

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.840
Sir Taiki...

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:07.040
PawnChessmon, melt the ice!

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:10.780
ToyAgumon, shoot your flames!

00:01:17.730 --> 00:01:20.610
Everyone, the General will 
be on his feet again soon!

00:01:21.050 --> 00:01:24.490
Until then, I'm the substitute General!

00:01:25.650 --> 00:01:28.270
What's all this 
"substitute General" business?

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:33.600
Shoutmon, they're coming from the air!

00:01:33.600 --> 00:01:35.940
Finally, it's my turn!

00:01:35.940 --> 00:01:38.490
Already?!

00:01:38.490 --> 00:01:42.260
Behold the shout of my soul!

00:01:42.910 --> 00:01:46.480
Rowdy Rocker!

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:52.470
That's no good.

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:56.190
This is the Digital age!

00:01:56.190 --> 00:01:58.830
Oh, dear. The Icemon army loses this one.

00:01:58.830 --> 00:02:00.260
So they're on the defensive

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:02.710
while they wait for Taiki to recover?

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.070
I might finally get to see it.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:08.490
See what? The switch to digital?

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.780
The true strength of Xros Heart.

00:02:14.550 --> 00:02:17.910
How's the thawing coming along, IceDevimon?

00:02:17.910 --> 00:02:19.820
Quite well.

00:02:19.820 --> 00:02:22.150
But why do you need such 
a terrifying Digimon?

00:02:23.020 --> 00:02:25.660
To take over where your useless self failed.

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:27.680
Wh-What?!

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:32.060
Lady Lilithmon, I can still help you!

00:02:32.060 --> 00:02:35.520
At this rate, I just might explo—

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:37.340
Oh, well.

00:02:37.730 --> 00:02:40.270
I just have to be a little more serious

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:43.090
if I want to claim the Code Crown.

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:49.850
There! How's that?

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:54.460
It spins much better now.

00:02:54.970 --> 00:02:57.340
I'm great at mechanical stuff.

00:02:57.340 --> 00:02:58.780
Thank you.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:00.740
What's with you?

00:03:00.740 --> 00:03:03.280
You're suddenly all fired up to fight.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:04.310
Akari?

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.570
What's up? You're in a bad mood.

00:03:06.570 --> 00:03:09.190
The princess is keeping Taiki to herself.

00:03:09.190 --> 00:03:10.770
Oh, that's all?

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:12.540
That's not it!

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:13.990
Then what is it?

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:16.590
I have no choice but to 
fill in for him now, right?

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:19.480
It's not as if I like fighting, but...

00:03:19.480 --> 00:03:21.040
I know that!

00:03:21.750 --> 00:03:23.640
I know that... I just...

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:24.490
Jerk!

00:03:25.280 --> 00:03:26.950
Nothing abnormal.

00:03:33.860 --> 00:03:36.530
Night watch sure is exhausting.

00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:38.680
Hey, it's Akari.

00:03:38.680 --> 00:03:40.470
What's she doing at this hour?

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.780
I wonder what they're all doing.

00:03:47.450 --> 00:03:48.800
I...

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:51.710
Akari.

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:54.990
Akari, over here.

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:56.980
Mom?

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:58.980
What's she doing?

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:01.090
Weird girl.

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:04.420
I've got one.

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:12.850
Mom, are you in there?

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:17.530
Mom?

00:04:21.270 --> 00:04:23.630
Mom, I...

00:04:24.430 --> 00:04:25.640
Akari?

00:04:25.640 --> 00:04:27.010
Mom!

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:28.980
I...

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:31.720
Akari, are you in there?

00:04:34.250 --> 00:04:37.010
Mom! What is it, Mom?

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.920
What are you doing here, Akari?

00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:43.990
Shoutmon, this mirror is 
connected to the human world!

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:46.220
I can talk to my mother through it!

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:47.270
This thing?

00:04:47.270 --> 00:04:49.490
It's just an ordinary mirror.

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:56.140
Crap, it broke!

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:58.460
See? Just an ordinary mirror.

00:04:58.790 --> 00:05:01.000
I can understand that you're upset

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.660
since the princess is keeping 
Taiki to herself, but...

00:05:02.660 --> 00:05:04.300
You insensitive jerk!

00:05:04.300 --> 00:05:06.730
I'm sick of the Digital World!

00:05:06.730 --> 00:05:09.090
Akari?

00:05:10.110 --> 00:05:12.240
The Digital World can just...

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:17.200
Akari?

00:05:18.590 --> 00:05:19.860
Mom?

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:25.000
Akari, abandon the Digital 
World and come home.

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.810
But how do I do that?

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:30.170
Find the Code Crown.

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:32.940
It's somewhere in this castle.

00:05:32.940 --> 00:05:35.080
Okay, Mom.

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.500
Hurry now, Akari.

00:05:47.030 --> 00:05:49.260
Ice mirror magic...

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:52.700
Now I know another of your tricks.

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.280
Am I hearing things?

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:58.640
Lady Lilithmon!

00:05:58.930 --> 00:06:00.900
The thawing is complete!

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:03.000
What shall we do now?

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:05.170
Oh? That was quick.

00:06:05.170 --> 00:06:07.430
Wh-What are you doing?!

00:06:07.430 --> 00:06:10.420
Lady Lilithmon!

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:26.260
The statue of the sword 
beckons all to the heavens.

00:06:26.260 --> 00:06:29.480
I shall conceal it within my fist.

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.270
Akari?

00:06:35.270 --> 00:06:38.280
I'm going back to the human world.

00:06:38.280 --> 00:06:39.870
Going... back?

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.420
What's the big idea?!

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:51.740
Aren't you supposed to be on night watch?

00:06:51.740 --> 00:06:55.190
W-W-Wait! I can explain!

00:06:55.190 --> 00:06:58.390
Akari said she could see the human world

00:06:58.390 --> 00:07:00.980
in a mirror and wouldn't let me sleep!

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:02.740
I knew it!

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:04.190
In a mirror?

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:06.970
I'm sorry. I won't do it again.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:09.610
It's Akari.

00:07:10.070 --> 00:07:11.990
What's she doing out there?

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:14.310
That's strange.

00:07:14.310 --> 00:07:17.830
All the lakes surrounding 
the castle are frozen.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:18.980
What?

00:07:25.890 --> 00:07:28.710
I found the Code Crown.

00:07:29.390 --> 00:07:31.800
That's it, Akari.

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.240
This means...

00:07:34.240 --> 00:07:36.300
The Code Crown has been stolen?!

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:40.290
One of the Three Head Officers 
uses mirror magic.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:43.610
So Akari was manipulated into 
stealing the Code Crown?

00:07:43.960 --> 00:07:47.210
Her name is Lilithmon.

00:07:55.090 --> 00:07:56.170
What?!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:58.320
Is this... my fault?

00:07:58.320 --> 00:07:59.450
Akari...

00:08:02.480 --> 00:08:06.160
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:08:06.160 --> 00:08:08.680
They may be made up of data,

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:13.300
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:15.610
Join us in our world of adventure

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:19.180
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:20.240
DigiXros!

00:09:52.640 --> 00:09:54.150
All right, everyone!

00:09:54.150 --> 00:09:56.920
Time to get Akari and the Code Crown back!

00:09:59.180 --> 00:10:01.550
Don't use long range weapons!

00:10:01.550 --> 00:10:03.410
They could hit Akari!

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.090
Charge!

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:16.370
Don't falter!

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:18.790
I have an ace up my sleeve!

00:10:21.290 --> 00:10:25.670
No one can stop the power of Daipenmon!

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:31.740
Why must I be treated this way?

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:34.910
Daipenmon...

00:10:34.910 --> 00:10:36.410
Unleash your fury!

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:46.590
What power!

00:10:58.540 --> 00:10:59.440
Akari?!

00:11:02.400 --> 00:11:04.340
Just a dream...

00:11:04.340 --> 00:11:06.260
Sir Taiki...

00:11:06.260 --> 00:11:09.180
You've been looking after me all this time?

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:09.810
But...

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:17.220
It's just not the same if it's not Akari.

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:20.190
I still feel kinda shaky...

00:11:20.190 --> 00:11:22.360
Playtime is over.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:27.130
What shocking power!

00:11:35.490 --> 00:11:37.180
What's going on?

00:11:41.180 --> 00:11:42.850
Wh-What's all this?

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:44.650
Akari?

00:11:51.360 --> 00:11:52.860
Akari!

00:11:53.950 --> 00:11:56.560
Knightmon really saved my skin.

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:58.100
Hey...

00:11:58.400 --> 00:12:00.870
Is he going after Akari by himself?!

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:02.400
I'll be borrowing this!

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:07.370
Don't be crazy!

00:12:07.370 --> 00:12:08.310
Zenjirou!

00:12:08.310 --> 00:12:09.820
I've gotta save Akari!

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:12.590
I'm sorry... This happened 
while I was with her.

00:12:12.590 --> 00:12:13.910
It's my fault.

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.780
It's <i>our</i> fault.

00:12:16.780 --> 00:12:21.210
You did your best while I was passed out!

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:21.850
Still...

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:24.790
Come on! We've gotta save Akari!

00:12:24.790 --> 00:12:26.140
We?

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:28.670
Both of us, together!

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:29.430
Right!

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:32.700
I think these are yours.

00:12:32.700 --> 00:12:33.030
Yeah.

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:35.870
Let's go, General!

00:12:35.870 --> 00:12:36.910
Right!

00:12:48.790 --> 00:12:50.150
She won't let go...

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:53.180
Is she resisting giving it to me?

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:55.400
If it's come to this...

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:57.820
I'll just take your arm, too!

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:59.090
H-How cruel...

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:02.260
I'm an ice demon, and that 
chills me to the bone.

00:13:04.110 --> 00:13:07.600
Daipenmon! Are you trying 
to eat me?! Stop!

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:10.900
Now, this will hurt a 
bit, but try to bear it.

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:18.240
Who's there?!

00:13:19.730 --> 00:13:21.250
Let Akari go!

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:22.830
Well, well.

00:13:22.830 --> 00:13:25.570
So you brave boys are still alive?

00:13:26.010 --> 00:13:27.890
Akari, we're gonna save you!

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:29.360
Oh?

00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:32.600
Do you think that's what she wants?

00:13:34.460 --> 00:13:37.860
Look. It's the Code Crown.

00:13:37.860 --> 00:13:40.460
With this, I can go back to the human world.

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:44.040
That's right. Now you can 
go back to the human world.

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.660
Akari?

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:47.620
I'm going home.

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:50.680
I'm just so...

00:13:50.680 --> 00:13:54.190
sick of the Digital World.

00:13:54.190 --> 00:13:58.220
I'm not needed here.

00:13:58.220 --> 00:13:59.280
Akari...

00:14:04.680 --> 00:14:06.990
Don't say you're not needed!

00:14:07.990 --> 00:14:10.400
I need you!

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:17.140
You've been my support since 
we came to the Digital World!

00:14:17.510 --> 00:14:20.270
So I do need you!

00:14:21.840 --> 00:14:23.230
I...

00:14:23.230 --> 00:14:26.910
That's right. I need you too, Akari.

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:29.410
To become the Digimon King.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:34.020
All of us, your friends, need you.

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:37.490
I'm...

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:39.910
Shoutmon! Ballistamon!

00:14:41.430 --> 00:14:43.390
Dorulumon! Cutemon!

00:14:44.390 --> 00:14:46.480
Do you see now, Akari?

00:14:46.480 --> 00:14:48.600
Never say you're not needed again!

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:50.450
Akari!

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:53.120
Such impudent brats.

00:14:53.650 --> 00:14:55.890
But no matter how many of you there are,

00:14:55.890 --> 00:14:58.710
I won't give you the girl or the Code Crown.

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:03.760
I am... needed...

00:15:09.850 --> 00:15:13.940
My... My Code Crown...

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.590
It's not yours.

00:15:16.590 --> 00:15:17.870
What?

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:19.830
No! Has my spell...

00:15:20.130 --> 00:15:23.530
This is not yours!

00:15:27.990 --> 00:15:31.010
What do you think you're doing, little girl?

00:15:31.010 --> 00:15:32.160
Blood?

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:38.450
I'll explode!

00:15:41.490 --> 00:15:44.850
Oh, no! If Lady Lilithmon gets angry...

00:15:53.030 --> 00:15:54.480
Taiki!

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:55.750
Akari!

00:15:56.270 --> 00:15:57.640
Thank you.

00:15:57.640 --> 00:15:59.670
Welcome back, Akari.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:04.240
Hey, this is no time for 
an emotional reunion!

00:16:10.050 --> 00:16:13.580
IceDevimon-Daipenmon 
Assimilated Form!

00:16:13.580 --> 00:16:15.600
Prepare yourselves!

00:16:15.600 --> 00:16:17.810
Kill them all!

00:16:18.820 --> 00:16:21.160
Take this!

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:27.870
Absolute Zero Ice Crusher of Hell!

00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:31.220
What is this?!

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:31.760
It's...

00:16:31.760 --> 00:16:33.230
Shaved ice?!

00:16:34.310 --> 00:16:37.710
Knight! We must assist them!

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:40.990
Knightmon!

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:41.980
Unite!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.820
Master Taiki, we can't keep this up for long!

00:16:47.820 --> 00:16:51.590
Okay! We won't miss the 
opportunity you've given us!

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:54.190
We'll DigiXros, too!

00:16:54.190 --> 00:16:57.180
Wait! Your strength is still...

00:16:57.650 --> 00:16:58.730
It's okay.

00:16:58.960 --> 00:17:01.580
I've got my friends to back me up.

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.110
All of them...

00:17:03.950 --> 00:17:05.840
And you.

00:17:07.770 --> 00:17:09.010
Yeah.

00:17:11.830 --> 00:17:13.840
Go ahead, Taiki!

00:17:13.840 --> 00:17:16.140
Let's show 'em!

00:17:16.140 --> 00:17:16.960
Yeah!

00:17:18.920 --> 00:17:21.300
Bring everyone's strength together!

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:28.580
Shoutmon!

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:29.810
Ballistamon!

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:30.850
Dorulumon!

00:17:30.850 --> 00:17:31.820
Starmon!

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:32.970
Pickmons!

00:17:32.970 --> 00:17:34.070
Knightmon!

00:17:34.070 --> 00:17:35.610
PawnChessmons!

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:41.110
DigiXros!

00:17:49.330 --> 00:17:51.150
DigiXros!

00:18:19.110 --> 00:18:22.820
Shoutmon X4K!

00:18:25.150 --> 00:18:29.720
You think a DigiXros can defend 
against this Ice Crusher?

00:18:32.290 --> 00:18:35.690
What? It penetrated the 
Absolute Zero Ice Crusher?

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:37.660
Just who are you?!

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:39.170
You wanna know?

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:40.930
Then I'll tell you!

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:43.410
We are Xros Heart,

00:18:43.410 --> 00:18:46.970
a bond of burning hearts that's 
gonna change the world!

00:18:47.910 --> 00:18:50.980
And we'll never forgive you...

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:54.550
for toying with Akari's heart!

00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:56.900
Take this!

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.400
Xros Heart's...

00:19:00.150 --> 00:19:05.040
Burning Star Crusher!

00:19:05.860 --> 00:19:09.030
They got me!

00:19:10.230 --> 00:19:14.980
Of course. There's no way I 
could win with IceDevimon.

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.080
They showed her!

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:34.180
That's the power of Xros Heart...

00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:38.790
But it's a little too fiery for me.

00:19:44.890 --> 00:19:49.370
Now the Lake Zone is safe.

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:55.480
We have you to thank, General.

00:19:55.480 --> 00:19:59.310
Please allow us to accompany 
you on your journey.

00:19:59.310 --> 00:20:00.390
Knightmon...

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:01.860
Hold it.

00:20:01.860 --> 00:20:06.220
I'll accompany Sir Taiki, as well.

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:07.500
What?!

00:20:08.250 --> 00:20:11.830
I can, can't I, Sir Taiki?

00:20:13.880 --> 00:20:15.760
This doesn't bode well...

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.400
Oh well, why not?

00:20:19.420 --> 00:20:22.010
So Taiki won after all.

00:20:22.010 --> 00:20:25.710
So, are you going to 
compare me to him again?

00:20:25.710 --> 00:20:27.150
I've decided.

00:20:27.700 --> 00:20:29.670
Kiriha Aonuma,

